            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">How is it massaged?</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Setting aside the physical part of your mind, the mon is massaged with techniques drawn from guided meditation, hypnosis and NLP, to relax it deeply and for a time to unravel your critical and analytical thinking, enabling an emptiness of thought and full presence within the overall Yomonsni massage experience. </p>
